{"turn_id": "d20-t1", "session_id": "d20", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bert_as_feature_extractor", "text": "BERT is adopted as a feature extraction layer at the bottom of the multi-head selection framework, used to extract contextual features for each character in place of the original BiLSTM.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-f104344a5193cf6cee7ee29d"}]}, {"key": "semantic_enhanced_pretraining", "text": "BERT is further optimized by introducing a semantic-enhanced task during BERT pre-training.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-f104344a5193cf6cee7ee29d"}]}, {"key": "semantic_task_composition", "text": "The semantic-enhanced task incorporates previous sentence prediction and document level prediction, and BERT is pre-trained by combining MLM, NSP and this semantic-enhanced task together.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-c36b758941a50635b2471a56"}]}, {"key": "bert_pretrain_finetune_general", "text": "BERT uses bidirectional transformers to pre-train on a large unlabeled corpus and is then fine-tuned on other tasks; the paper reports optimizing its pre-training process rather than describing a task-specific fine-tuning procedure.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"}]}, {"key": "named_tech_list", "text": "Enhanced BERT pre-training, soft label embedding and NER pre-training are identified as the three main technologies introduced to further improve performance.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-0f3bf35195202e464e2739cc"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d20-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d20-t2", "session_id": "d20", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bert_feature_layer", "text": "论文将 BERT 作为特征提取层置于 multi-head selection 框架底部，并把 BERT 引入多头部选择框架以进行联合实体-关系抽取。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}]}, {"key": "replace_bilstm", "text": "论文用 BERT 逐字提取上下文特征，以替代原工作中的 BiLSTM。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"}]}, {"key": "semantic_enhanced_pretraining", "text": "论文在 BERT 预训练阶段引入 semantic-enhanced 任务来进一步优化 BERT。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"}]}, {"key": "ner_pretraining_corpus", "text": "论文引入大规模百度百科语料用于实体识别预训练，并称其为弱监督学习，因为没有真实的命名实体标注。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}]}, {"key": "soft_label_embedding", "text": "论文提出软标签嵌入（soft label embedding），用于在实体识别与关系抽取之间有效传递信息。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}]}, {"key": "three_technologies", "text": "论文结论称增强的 BERT 预训练、软标签嵌入和 NER 预训练是其引入以进一步改进性能的三项主要技术。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-0f3bf35195202e464e2739cc"}]}, {"key": "ablation_baseline", "text": "实验中的基线模型基于 Google BERT，使用硬标签嵌入，并且仅在 SKE 数据集上训练、不做 NER 预训练。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-81f156727678132b6842efe6"}]}, {"key": "ablation_f1", "text": "在 SKE 数据集上，结合论文增强 BERT 后 F1 从 0.864 升至 0.871；使用额外语料的 NER 预训练、软标签嵌入以及辅助的句子级关系分类预测也提升了 F1。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-81f156727678132b6842efe6"}]}, {"key": "single_model_score", "text": "结合上述各项贡献，单模型在 testset-1 上取得 F1 0.876。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-81f156727678132b6842efe6"}]}, {"key": "ensemble_score", "text": "集成四个模型变体后，论文在 testset-1 上取得 F1 0.892（第 1 名），在 testset-2 上取得 F1 0.8924（第 2 名）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"}, {"paper_id": "1908.05908", "chunk_id": "c-0f3bf35195202e464e2739cc"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d20-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
